    "q-333832": {
      "dom_id": "step-q333832",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=x(t)-y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=-3x(t)+3y(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear differential equations above. The eigenvalues of the system's matrix are ${\\lambda }_{1}=0$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=4,$ for which the corresponding eigenvectors are ${v}_{1}=[1,\\text{ }1]^{T}$ and ${v}_{2}=[-1,\\text{ }3]^{T},$ respectively. Which of the following could represent the phase portrait of the system?\n\n*Hint: Here, the dotted line represents the equilibrium solutions.*",
      "worked_solution": "The general solution of the system is\n\n$$\nx(t)=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}]={c}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+{c}_{2}{e}^{4t}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nLet's now sketch the phase portrait.\n\n- First, notice that ${x}_{E}(t)={c}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ are the equilibrium solutions of the system since ${x}_{E}^{′}(t)=0.$ These solutions form the line with the equation $y=x$ in the phase space, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14226345/assets/18fad31b9f69e55d9f4bc414d3e1b732eaee7685bf36a183033fc302e911eb82.png)\n\n- Now, the line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation \n$y=-3x$\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{4t}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line. Since ${e}^{4t}\\to \\infty $ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach infinity as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14226345/assets/2bfda58fee727ccdc9f424140e2b8143bf5afe426ef0b1fa72105272d9a1b41e.png)\n\nAll other non-equilibrium solutions are parallel to the vector ${v}_{2}.$ So, the phase portrait of our system looks as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14226345/assets/f0821717299fb0b9858409db9a93a610a75e0564a2b60f5bfcd6eca26d2909ec.png)",
